1374254,"x":0.09777777568110263},{"text":"A couple my friends are deep thinkers, which makes","w":0.395555534362793,"y":0.48243464051551044,"h":0.013204894034691161,"x":0.1000000145519368},{"y":0.49550653626717411,"h":0.014705882352941124,"w":0.40666664123535157,"text":"them interesting to talk to about life's ups and downs.","x":0.10000001453047233},{"x":0.073333345551179013,"y":0.52450980413959192,"w":0.42444442749023437,"h":0.013480392156862808,"text":"2 Though normally confident, many the people on the"},{"x":0.10000000588152397,"h":0.013271393339618354,"text":"stage that night were in fact very nervous.","y":0.5377906978008159,"w":0.3177777671813965},{"h":0.013261893995447083,"x":0.073333334016330382,"text":"3 Not all teenagers are eager to spend time with their","y":0.55087209314965302,"w":0.42222221374511726},{"w":0.18666666030883788,"text":"friends at the weekends.","y":0.56535947729947023,"h":0.011846405228758239,"x":0.097777784067803145},{"y":0.57843137220415874,"text":"4 No exam will ever be as hard as the one you have to","h":0.013138394729763858,"w":0.42444442749023442,"x":0.073333334810438619},{"text":"take at the end of this course.","h":0.010326417443019875,"w":0.22888887405395511,"y":0.59302325584723814,"x":0.097777789010059374},{"y":0.6059473323334259,"w":0.42021137237548833,"h":0.014997582030452206,"x":0.073219831998979495,"text":"5 Elsa's pen broke, but luckily none the ink spilled out"},{"h":0.011846405228758128,"text":"into her handbag.","x":0.097777780029819003,"y":0.62050653583899451,"w":0.13777777671813968},{"x":0.073333344857828664,"y":0.63517441848667755,"text":"6 Both rooms had been painted a shade of blue that","w":0.4133333206176758,"h":0.011627907067342513},{"w":0.32222221374511717,"h":0.011627907067342513,"x":0.097777781766330285,"text":"reminded Hannah of her favourite flowers.","y":0.64825581376284036},{"h":0.014705882352941124,"w":0.33333332061767584,"text":"3 * * Choose the correct answers A-C.","y":0.6670751636464588,"x":0.046666678580050809},{"h":0.016054871814702887,"text":"The Rise of Megacities","y":0.70494186059440267,"x":0.060000001714285676,"w":0.23999999999999996},{"y":0.72222222242823098,"x":0.06222222337853555,"h":0.014705882352941124,"w":0.43111110687255855,"text":"Until the mid-20th century,'_ people lived in rural areas, but now"},{"x":0.062222228652609533,"h":0.011627907067342513,"w":0.4311111068725586,"text":"the majority of the world's population lives in urban areas. Cities have","y":0.73691860454772407},{"text":"grown dramatically and 2","y":0.75000000002737521,"x":0.06222222198556409,"w":0.1555555534362793,"h":0.011627907067342513},{"y":0.75145348888003094,"h":0.013252393092984538,"text":"- of them have even become 'megacities',","w":0.27777776718139646,"x":0.21777778763152383},{"text":"the name given to urban areas with more than 10 million inhabitants.","x":0.06000001579082561,"y":0.76307189556979393,"w":0.41555553436279302,"h":0.011637406801086603},{"text":"According to the United Nations, there are currently 33 megacities, the","y":0.78052325591400318,"x":0.060000011218939768,"w":0.43333332061767577,"h":0.011627907067342513},{"text":"largest of which is Tokyo, Japan, with a population of 37 million. Unlike","h":0.011846405228758239,"x":0.060000000941162208,"w":0.43333332061767577,"y":0.79207516335349148},{"y":0.80514705878689852,"text":"Tokyo, 3-","x":0.060000001476304771,"w":0.055555553436279298,"h":0.011846405228758128},{"w":0.35555553436279297,"x":0.13777778244823335,"y":0.80668604685590162,"h":0.011627906288196765,"text":"the megacities are in poor countries. There, people leave"},{"text":"rural areas because there are 4","x":0.059999995519612687,"y":0.81821895426677937,"h":0.011846405228758128,"w":0.18888889312744139},{"y":0.81976744225318843,"text":"-opportunities for work or education,","h":0.011627906288196876,"x":0.25111111938670055,"w":0.24222221374511721},{"h":0.013185894567202872,"text":"and 5hope of a good life.","x":0.060000006631523932,"y":0.83129084954695232,"w":0.17777776718139646},{"text":"When there is rapid population growth, poor countries face _","h":0.011627906288196765,"x":0.060000012580050811,"y":0.84883720954970021,"w":0.37333332061767582},{"y":0.85029069748377051,"w":0.062222218513488747,"h":0.011627907067342624,"text":"social,","x":0.43111111340992225},{"h":0.013252393092984427,"y":0.86029411802698463,"w":0.33555553436279295,"x":0.060000015818603314,"text":"economic and environmental problems. Cities need ?"},{"text":"_clean water","w":0.091111106872558578,"x":0.40222222348964665,"h":0.010174418586531453,"y":0.86337209286274197},{"h":0.011627907067342513,"w":0.43333332061767577,"x":0.060000010691162016,"y":0.87499999992563093,"text":"and electricity, as well as hospitals, schools, rubbish removal facilities"},{"y":0.88807189542444498,"w":0.15777777671813967,"h":0.011637406411513784,"x":0.060000003159448596,"text":"and transport. But with 8_"},{"text":"money, it's almost impossible to keep up","y":0.88762435403580775,"x":0.21991783646935453,"w":0.27356338500976562,"h":0.013713253868950726},{"x":0.060000008520412818,"w":0.2577777671813965,"h":0.011846405228758239,"text":"with the demands of a growing population.","y":0.90114379075897688},{"x":0.060000006430387318,"h":0.011627907067342513,"text":"This is why megacities are one of the world's greatest challenges.","w":0.4311111068725586,"y":0.91860465108842182},{"x":0.060000007530472563,"w":0.42666664123535158,"h":0.013166894320569056,"text":"The question we need to ask is, 'Can our planet survive urban growth?'","y":0.93168604658351939},{"text":"42","w":0.028888888359069824,"x":0.051111111616761386,"y":0.96075581418284106,"h":0.013081394769007826},{"w":0.38666664123535155,"y":0.046511628153286799,"h":0.013128894606446839,"x":0.56666668324899094,"text":"* * * Complete the second sentence so that it"},{"h":0.011627907067342513,"y":0.062499999954700791,"w":0.41555553436279291,"text":"means the same as the first. Use the word in capitals.","x":0.566666682457